#. Description of the plugin
#: nectar-blocks.php
msgid ""
"Step into the future of WordPress with Nectarblocks, where innovation meets "
"seamless design. Unleash the full potential of your website by transforming "
"the core WordPress editor into a dynamic and robust full-site editor."
msgstr ""
"Entre no futuro do WordPress com Nectarblocks, onde a inovação encontra o "
"design perfeito. Libere todo o potencial do seu site transformando o editor "
"principal do WordPress em um editor completo de site dinâmico e robusto."

